{"voice":"Leela","pages":[{"text":"Arun builds a tall block tower. A ball bumps it, and crash! The tower falls.","words":[[0,0.36],[0.44,0.78],[0.82,0.87],[0.94,1.24],[1.31,1.63],[1.7,2.24],[2.62,2.71],[2.8,3.05],[3.13,3.47],[3.53,3.7],[3.73,3.9],[4,4.71],[5,5.14],[5.21,5.54],[5.63,6.55]]},{"text":"Arun feels heat in his cheeks and tight fists. He feels very angry.","words":[[0,0.35],[0.42,0.71],[0.8,1.04],[1.1,1.2],[1.26,1.42],[1.5,1.88],[1.93,2.07],[2.15,2.52],[2.6,3.23],[3.55,3.69],[3.76,4.05],[4.16,4.5],[4.59,5.43]]},{"text":"He wants to shout, but he remembers the class safety rule.","words":[[0,0.19],[0.24,0.5],[0.56,0.63],[0.72,1.13],[1.17,1.33],[1.39,1.49],[1.58,2.13],[2.17,2.24],[2.31,2.69],[2.75,3.16],[3.23,3.9]]},{"text":"Arun steps to the calm spot and takes dragon breaths: in and out.","words":[[0,0.35],[0.43,0.8],[0.85,0.92],[0.99,1.06],[1.13,1.54],[1.61,1.99],[2.04,2.16],[2.22,2.53],[2.6,3.04],[3.1,3.7],[4.03,4.31],[4.41,4.64],[4.78,5.67]]},{"text":"He counts slowly to ten while opening and closing his hands.","words":[[0,0.19],[0.27,0.64],[0.69,1.15],[1.22,1.31],[1.39,1.68],[1.76,2.03],[2.1,2.51],[2.57,2.63],[2.71,3.12],[3.19,3.32],[3.4,4.23]]},{"text":"His body feels less tight. His heart beats slower.","words":[[0,0.24],[0.31,0.59],[0.65,0.93],[1.01,1.25],[1.31,1.76],[1.82,2.02],[2.1,2.39],[2.46,2.74],[2.79,3.67]]},{"text":"Now Arun uses words: I felt mad when my tower fell.","words":[[0,0.26],[0.35,0.65],[0.73,1.08],[1.16,1.7],[1.99,2.04],[2.18,2.45],[2.54,2.81],[2.87,3.05],[3.11,3.23],[3.31,3.68],[3.79,4.46]]},{"text":"His friend says sorry and helps rebuild the tower.","words":[[0,0.27],[0.35,0.69],[0.76,1],[1.08,1.51],[1.58,1.73],[1.81,2.13],[2.22,2.72],[2.76,2.83],[2.89,3.76]]},{"text":"They build an even stronger tower with a wider base.","words":[[0,0.27],[0.35,0.64],[0.7,0.79],[0.87,1.1],[1.17,1.68],[1.76,2.13],[2.19,2.36],[2.4,2.43],[2.51,2.87],[2.95,3.76]]},{"text":"Arun learns anger is okay, and safe actions help it shrink.","words":[[0,0.34],[0.41,0.8],[0.88,1.2],[1.26,1.37],[1.46,2.02],[2.07,2.28],[2.37,2.71],[2.75,3.16],[3.22,3.41],[3.48,3.58],[3.63,4.46]]}]}